---
import BlogPostLayout from "../../layouts/BlogPostLayout.astro";
---

<BlogPostLayout
	title="凤城全域虚拟电厂智慧驾驶舱"
	description="凤城全域虚拟电厂智慧驾驶舱项目入口"
	keywords="凤城,虚拟电厂,智慧驾驶舱,能源调度,数据可视化"
>
	<div class="post">
		<main class="project-detail">
			<section class="detail-hero">
				<div class="detail-kicker">ENERGY DASHBOARD</div>
				<h1>凤城全域虚拟电厂智慧驾驶舱</h1>
				<p>
					面向全域能源调度、负荷聚合、运行态势感知和管理决策的智慧驾驶舱项目。
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="detail-board" aria-label="项目驾驶舱预览">
				<div class="board-map">
					<div class="node node-a"></div>
					<div class="node node-b"></div>
					<div class="node node-c"></div>
					<div class="node node-d"></div>
					<div class="route route-a"></div>
					<div class="route route-b"></div>
					<div class="route route-c"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="board-panel panel-a">
					<span>实时负荷</span>
					<strong>86.4%</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="board-panel panel-b">
					<span>聚合资源</span>
					<strong>128</strong>
				</div>
				<div class="board-chart">
					<span style="height: 46%"></span>
					<span style="height: 74%"></span>
					<span style="height: 56%"></span>
					<span style="height: 88%"></span>
					<span style="height: 62%"></span>
					<span style="height: 78%"></span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="detail-content border-top">
				<h2>项目说明</h2>
				<p>
					这里先作为项目入口保留。后续可以补充项目背景、产品架构、关键页面、数据指标、交互流程和视觉方案。
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</BlogPostLayout>

<style lang="scss">
	.project-detail {
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.detail-hero {
		margin: 40px auto 32px;
		text-align: center;

		h1 {
			max-width: 780px;
			margin: 18px auto 16px;
			font-size: 3.6rem;
			line-height: 1.16;
		}

		p {
			max-width: 620px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			color: var(--color-300);
			text-align: center;
		}
	}

	.detail-kicker {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		min-height: 32px;
		padding: 0 16px;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-700);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: var(--color-300);
		font-family: var(--font-type);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	.detail-board {
		position: relative;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr;
		grid-template-rows: 150px 150px;
		gap: 14px;
		min-height: 420px;
		padding: 18px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background:
			linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(73, 154, 213, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
			linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(73, 154, 213, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
			linear-gradient(135deg, #eef8f4 0%, #f8fbff 46%, #dfeeff 100%);
		background-size: 32px 32px, 32px 32px, auto;
		box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
	}

	.board-map,
	.board-panel,
	.board-chart {
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
	}

	.board-map {
		position: relative;
		grid-row: span 2;
	}

	.node,
	.route {
		position: absolute;
	}

	.node {
		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		border: 3px solid var(--color-white);
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--color-green);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(27, 196, 125, 0.35);
	}

	.node-a {
		top: 24%;
		left: 18%;
	}

	.node-b {
		top: 42%;
		right: 20%;
		background: var(--color-blue);
	}

	.node-c {
		bottom: 22%;
		left: 34%;
		background: var(--color-yellow);
	}

	.node-d {
		bottom: 18%;
		right: 28%;
	}

	.route {
		height: 3px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-blue);
		opacity: 0.72;
		transform-origin: left center;
	}

	.route-a {
		top: 31%;
		left: 20%;
		width: 58%;
		transform: rotate(14deg);
	}

	.route-b {
		top: 56%;
		left: 34%;
		width: 36%;
		transform: rotate(-28deg);
	}

	.route-c {
		bottom: 28%;
		left: 36%;
		width: 36%;
		transform: rotate(8deg);
	}

	.board-panel {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 24px;

		span {
			color: var(--color-400);
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}

		strong {
			margin-top: 10px;
			color: var(--color-100);
			font-family: var(--font-type);
			font-size: 2.6rem;
			line-height: 1;
		}
	}

	.board-chart {
		display: flex;
		align-items: end;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 24px;

		span {
			flex: 1;
			min-height: 20px;
			border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-blue), var(--color-green));
		}
	}

	.detail-content {
		margin-top: 42px;
		padding-top: 28px;

		h2 {
			margin-bottom: 16px;
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}

		p {
			max-width: 680px;
			color: var(--color-300);
		}
	}

	@media(max-width: 767px) {
		.detail-hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.2rem;
		}

		.detail-board {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			grid-template-rows: 260px auto auto 140px;
		}

		.board-map {
			grid-row: auto;
		}
	}
</style>
